stone branch is working to ensure the successful commencement of operations for first combined CSP and PV solar park in the world as scheduled for Q4 2023. ","projectImage1":"[{\"key\":\"4baa24be-700f-4c38-a4ee-304bb24479d0\",\"mediaKey\":\"95e4fdff-f491-4d0b-a84d-ed65087169be\"}]","projectImage2":"[{\"key\":\"6863a087-96f9-414c-b155-23e6e1edca8e\",\"mediaKey\":\"e98c2dca-c7fb-4d20-aaea-bc4fa27b610d\"}]","projectImage3":"[{\"key\":\"63ec18ff-2539-4373-8d58-b51d4bd9df64\",\"mediaKey\":\"4b5321f7-a344-4598-95ae-69f57072528c\"}]"},{"contentTypeKey":"f2bf9cc9-ed35-4e1b-bf63-feaf3102c58b","udi":"umb://element/e84a22aa761244b984a8de36805a36f5","PropType":null,"projectNumber":"06","projectHeadingTop":"Beitbridge Border Post","projectHeadingBottom":"Upgrade Project","projectLocation":"Zimbabwe","projectHeadingBackgroundImage":"[{\"key\":\"001dbeac-cfd4-4bc7-b900-4be224d54788\",\"mediaKey\":\"8de40cee-4581-453c-b126-0e7b47a6857f\"}]","yearOfProject":"2022","projectClient":"Zimborders","projectBudget":"R3 billion","projectServices":"Site Investigations\nGeotechnical Investigations\nConcrete Quality Assurance","projectLinks":"{\r\n  \"markup\": \"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.zimborders.com/projects/\\\"\u003eBeitbridge Border Project\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\r\n  \"blocks\": {\r\n    \"contentData\": [],\r\n    \"settingsData\": []\r\n  }\r\n}","projectDescription":"Roadlab continues to verify the quality and durability of all material at the Beitbridge Border Post, the busiest border post in Southern Africa, connecting South Africa to Zimbabwe and the rest of Africa.","projectImage1":"[{\"key\":\"4ed21225-19f8-49e1-9dee-7f4465356cbe\",\"mediaKey\":\"92196f38-3aab-4bb9-ab76-176dd5d24474\"}]","projectImage2":"[{\"key\":\"746decb9-2346-40f6-bc2c-299e3c6920b5\",\"mediaKey\":\"19195d92-1a07-4708-b82c-864208fba9f8\"}]","projectImage3":"[{\"key\":\"d790e060-1477-4395-a574-725654c5daea\",\"mediaKey\":\"0b6cba95-5b9a-4f49-a133-e3628e58c6d5\"}]"},{"contentTypeKey":"f2bf9cc9-ed35-4e1b-bf63-feaf3102c58b","udi":"umb://element/e0b8df23827a45a7a1514a85c5c2a559","PropType":null,"projectNumber":"07","projectHeadingTop":"DLARRD","projectHeadingBottom":"New Government Offices","projectLocation":"Gauteng","projectHeadingBackgroundImage":"[{\"key\":\"ffc5eb7c-58b9-4740-a6b8-f22341db3e35\",\"mediaKey\":\"bfc663a6-644d-4562-bc1e-9e8473aecffb\"}]","yearOfProject":"2021 - 2022","projectClient":"WBHO Construction","projectBudget":"R200 million","projectServices":"Concrete Quality Assurance","projectLinks":"{\r\n  \"markup\": \"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.keller-africa.co.za/projects/dalrrd-building\\\"\u003eDALRRD offices\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\r\n  \"blocks\": {\r\n    \"contentData\": [],\r\n    \"settingsData\": []\r\n  }\r\n}","projectDescription":"Roadlab is ensuring the quality, workability and strength of all concrete sent to site for what will become the new centralized head office for the Department of Agriculture, Land Reform and Rural Development.","projectImage1":"[{\"key\":\"c4d1397e-3e4b-4e97-8afa-af3831e36bf0\",\"mediaKey\":\"218d2e30-d966-4651-b80d-0cbcd5e4b09f\"}]","projectImage2":"[{\"key\":\"eaf910f6-b6fe-47c1-b274-958cdc96fa46\",\"mediaKey\":\"61fde52c-2499-4e6d-a2d2-03994cd034f0\"}]","projectImage3":"[{\"key\":\"1fae4a32-cd36-4777-b577-867dc69df0b0\",\"mediaKey\":\"2f5052d2-0200-4c74-932d-970b419cd869\"}]"},{"contentTypeKey":"f2bf9cc9-ed35-4e1b-bf63-feaf3102c58b","udi":"umb://element/bcec96040a904109bd3e85738f12de94","PropType":null,"projectNumber":"08","projectHeadingTop":"Saldanha OTMS","projectHeadingBottom":"(Oil Tanking Mogs Saldanha)","projectLocation":"Western Cape","projectHeadingBackgroundImage":"[{\"key\":\"56289515-d46e-40a1-a90b-66d1d0f56c25\",\"mediaKey\":\"07df728f-4f99-40c9-b68f-0bbdd615e58c\"}]","yearOfProject":"2016 - 2020","projectClient":"WBHO","projectBudget":"R2.8 billion","projectServices":"Concrete Quality Assurance","projectLinks":"{\r\n  \"markup\": \"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=an6rEt-iF9I\\\"\u003eOil Tanking Mogs Saldanha\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\r\n  \"blocks\": {\r\n    \"contentData\": [],\r\n    \"settingsData\": []\r\n  }\r\n}","projectDescription":"800 cubic meters of concrete was cast each day on the OTMS project. We ensured the quality, workability and strength of all concrete while monitoring strict temperature controls on the concrete batching temperature. ","projectImage1":"[{\"key\":\"6eccdc4c-8748-4b5e-a369-2adc1873d2c2\",\"mediaKey\":\"6ccae960-fb47-4ce4-8232-551e35adc394\"}]","projectImage2":"[{\"key\":\"8a021f72-ae38-473a-9a3f-84ffd5e19750\",\"mediaKey\":\"42acff54-acc5-47d1-95e8-2c72803ab04e\"}]","projectImage3":"[{\"key\":\"1dc19ed7-addf-42ea-8965-c28adfde819b\",\"mediaKey\":\"ab3e6d46-366b-48e0-a768-4e271c9b05a3\"}]"},{"contentTypeKey":"f2bf9cc9-ed35-4e1b-bf63-feaf3102c58b","udi":"umb://element/14e922e9a2b64a2e80fbda935bb80467","PropType":null,"projectNumber":"09","projectHeadingTop":"Transnet Multi-Phased ","projectHeadingBottom":"Terminal Upgrade","projectLocation":"Western Cape","projectHeadingBackgroundImage":"[{\"key\":\"afd4d569-d1c2-43f4-b8b7-93ea6c804952\",\"mediaKey\":\"12971a02-c729-4794-b754-0ce8727876e9\"}]","yearOfProject":"2019 – 2020","projectClient":"HHO Consulting Engineers","projectBudget":"Ongoing","projectServices":"FWD Investigations\n","projectLinks":"{\r\n  \"markup\": \"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca rel=\\\"noopener\\\" href=\\\"https://www.transnetportterminals.net/Ports/Pages/CapeTown_Multi.aspx\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003eTerminal Upgrade\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\r\n  \"blocks\": {\r\n    \"contentData\": [],\r\n    \"settingsData\": []\r\n  }\r\n}","projectDescription":"Roadlab was appointed by HHO Consulting Engineers to enable benchmarking of the stiffness of the port\u0027s various layers to include in a pavement loading analysis. This would go on to be used in the deriving of pavement-strengthening options for improved container stacking efficiency.","projectImage1":"[{\"key\":\"cef22fcc-8a28-45fd-990d-953619604fd1\",\"mediaKey\":\"90e3b416-3c07-4d7a-8b85-6ecb16b4d7ad\"}]","projectImage2":"[{\"key\":\"b2009251-cc61-4039-a28d-e0fca53af3df\",\"mediaKey\":\"9e264563-8827-42ac-93f2-428b01194db4\"}]","projectImage3":"[{\"key\":\"8aa0f624-000b-4362-9405-01d06d714a33\",\"mediaKey\":\"3ea51320-3410-4cd4-8771-80667ac306d2\"}]"},{"contentTypeKey":"f2bf9cc9-ed35-4e1b-bf63-feaf3102c58b","udi":"umb://element/3f32684bce6b4dfba20848a2f55f043c","PropType":null,"projectNumber":"10","projectHeadingTop":"Louis Fourie Integrated Settlement ","projectHeadingBottom":"Housing Development","projectLocation":"Western Cape","projectHeadingBackgroundImage":"[{\"key\":\"7d72f2ba-9e63-46ba-a3f2-e432724aee18\",\"mediaKey\":\"be212330-6ed3-490f-b19c-3501adfc18e0\"}]","yearOfProject":"2017 – 2020","projectClient":"Department of Public Works and Roads ","projectBudget":"R80 million","projectServices":"Housing Development Construction","projectLinks":"{\r\n  \"markup\": \"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca rel=\\\"noopener\\\" href=\\\"https://www.mosselbay.gov.za/download_document/6427\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003eLouis Fourie Integrated Settlement \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\r\n  \"blocks\": {\r\n    \"contentData\": [],\r\n    \"settingsData\": []\r\n  }\r\n}","projectDescription":"Roadlab assisted in the construction of over 2000 housing units. We performed concrete and site investigations on constructed layer works and mix designs to improve the structural integrity and soundness of construction materials.","projectImage1":"[{\"key\":\"e86edca5-9d32-4100-b603-8f9f2b035b1b\",\"mediaKey\":\"ec593274-8586-4c51-a950-3e2a507eb4ec\"}]","projectImage2":"[{\"key\":\"c9193caf-bbd8-422b-a0da-fb471e4014c8\",\"mediaKey\":\"b470049c-2cc0-4f06-9edf-223b4443032b\"}]","projectImage3":"[{\"key\":\"61d7413f-eecb-4077-8a61-7a98927ab066\",\"mediaKey\":\"d7e0e537-4819-4020-8a1d-43a92da95ffc\"}]"},{"contentTypeKey":"f2bf9cc9-ed35-4e1b-bf63-feaf3102c58b","udi":"umb